    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/70/Felicia_catgirl_Dreamer.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241112035933\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Felicia catgirl Dreamer\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/7/70/Felicia_catgirl_Dreamer.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241112035933\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"595\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Felicia catgirl Dreamer.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Felicia_catgirl_Dreamer.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>猫咪梦想家</b>\n</p><p>一位在人类世界大放异彩的音乐明星猫娘。她毫不犹豫地投身于黑暗之蚀之间的战斗，只因为惩治恶人才能换来和平。幼年被遗弃却心地善良，她建立了一座孤儿院，将自己的幸福分享给每一个人。\n\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a4/Felicidades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241101200259\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Felicidades Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a4/Felicidades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20241101200259\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"933\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Felicidades Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Felicidades_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/db/Felicia_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241101200258\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Felicia S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/db/Felicia_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=